AppleSMC ABI declarations and read protocol in internal/metrics/cpu_smc.go and cpu_hardware_darwin.go, and the libproc ABI/time conversion in
internal/metrics/process_counters_darwin.go, are adapted from gopsutil v4.26.9:
https://github.com/shirou/gopsutil/tree/v4.26.9

AppleSMC endpoint selection, IOReport subscription protocol, CLPC channel
descriptors, CPU report IDs and energy conversion are adapted from macmon:
https://github.com/vladkens/macmon/tree/3f738177f6f87a08ba3d977540be6793b73863bc

